{"lines": ["Two blips on a radar screen became one. And a jet with two men inside was never seen again.", "November 1953. Radar catches something over Lake Superior, in restricted airspace.", "A jet scrambles into the storm. Pilot Felix Moncla, radar man Robert Wilson.", "For thirty minutes, ground control talks them closer. Eight thousand feet.", "Then the two dots touch. Controllers wait for them to split. They never do.", "One blip flies on alone. The jet's signal, gone. The radio, silent.", "And that's not the strange part. The Air Force first said the jet merged with an object.", "Then the story changed. A lost Canadian plane, and a dizzy pilot who crashed.", "Case closed? Canada said none of its planes were there. And no wreck was ever found.", "So what did that jet fly into? Tell me below."], "words": [["Two", 0.0, 0.1], ["blips", 0.1, 0.5], ["on", 0.5, 0.64], ["a", 0.64, 0.74], ["radar", 0.74, 0.96], ["screen", 0.96, 1.44], ["became", 1.44, 1.88], ["one.", 1.88, 2.28], ["And", 2.68, 2.92], ["a", 2.92, 2.98], ["jet", 2.98, 3.2], ["with", 3.2, 3.46], ["two", 3.46, 3.68], ["men", 3.68, 3.96], ["inside", 3.96, 4.38], ["was", 4.38, 4.8], ["never", 4.8, 5.02], ["seen", 5.02, 5.42], ["again.", 5.42, 5.72], ["November", 6.474, 6.8], ["1953.", 6.8, 7.82], ["Radar", 8.9, 9.36], ["catches", 9.36, 9.8], ["something", 9.8, 10.18], ["over", 10.18, 10.58], ["Lake", 10.58, 10.76], ["Superior,", 10.76, 11.3], ["in", 11.3, 11.86], ["restricted", 11.86, 12.24], ["airspace.", 12.24, 12.78], ["A", 13.84, 13.88], ["jet", 13.88, 14.08], ["scrambles", 14.08, 14.78], ["into", 14.78, 15.02], ["the", 15.02, 15.18], ["storm.", 15.18, 15.54], ["Pilot", 16.22, 16.44], ["Felix", 16.44, 16.78], ["Moncla,", 16.78, 17.44], ["radar", 17.64, 17.92], ["man", 17.92, 18.28], ["Robert", 18.28, 18.74], ["Wilson.", 18.74, 19.04], ["For", 19.962, 20.1], ["thirty", 20.1, 20.4], ["minutes,", 20.4, 20.76], ["ground", 21.04, 21.18], ["control", 21.18, 21.64], ["talks", 21.64, 22.04], ["them", 22.04, 22.3